---
layout: default
---
{% comment %}
The portfolio index. `groups` in the page's front matter lists campaigns by
permalink, so their order is deliberate; anything in the collection that no
group lists still renders underneath, so adding a campaign to _portfolio can
never make it silently disappear from this page.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="call-out call-out_solid">
    <h1 class="call-out_title">{{ page.title }}</h1>
</div>

{% if page.subtitle %}
<p class="portfolio-index__subtitle">{{ page.subtitle }}</p>
{% endif %}

{% assign grouped = "" %}
{% for g in page.groups %}
  {% for u in g.items %}{% assign grouped = grouped | append: u | append: "|" %}{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}

{% for g in page.groups %}
<section class="portfolio-group">
    <h2 class="portfolio-group__title">{{ g.title }}</h2>
    {% if g.blurb %}<p class="portfolio-group__blurb">{{ g.blurb }}</p>{% endif %}
    {% comment %}
    A horizontally-scrollable row rather than a static grid — one card
    dominates the view with the next peeking at the edge (trackpad swipe,
    touch drag, mouse wheel, or the arrows all move it), closer to a
    single-focus carousel than a multi-up grid. scroll-carousel.js hides the
    arrows when a group is short enough that there's nothing to scroll to.
    {% endcomment %}
    <div class="campaign-scroll" data-scroll-carousel>
        <button type="button" class="campaign-scroll__arrow campaign-scroll__arrow--prev" data-scroll-prev aria-label="Scroll {{ g.title }} left" hidden>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5 7 12l8 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="campaign-scroll__track" data-scroll-track role="region" aria-label="{{ g.title }} campaigns" tabindex="0">
            {% for u in g.items %}
            {% assign item = site.portfolio | where: "url", u | first %}
            {% if item %}{% include portfolio/card.liquid item=item %}{% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="campaign-scroll__arrow campaign-scroll__arrow--next" data-scroll-next aria-label="Scroll {{ g.title }} right" hidden>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 5 8 7-8 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
    </div>
</section>
{% endfor %}

<script defer src="{{ '/assets/js/scroll-carousel.js' | relative_url }}?v={{ site.time | date: '%s' }}"></script>

{% comment %} Whatever no group claimed — including everything, when a page sets no groups at all. {% endcomment %}
{% capture rest %}
  {% for item in site.portfolio %}
    {% unless grouped contains item.url %}{% include portfolio/card.liquid item=item %}{% endunless %}
  {% endfor %}
{% endcapture %}
{% assign rest_has_cards = rest | strip %}
{% if rest_has_cards != "" %}
<section class="portfolio-group">
    {% if page.groups %}<h2 class="portfolio-group__title">{{ page.rest_title | default: 'More Work' }}</h2>{% endif %}
    <div class="portfolio-index">{{ rest }}</div>
</section>
{% endif %}
